## Resolution, 21 November 2026

The user confirmed satisfaction with keeping the feeder analysis in the repository and suggested giving its result a few sentences in Results if space permits. Keep the primary seven-transfer figure in the repository. A short text mention may give the overall count and one example, keeping the 2,396-arrival denominator, the within-season sending and receiving totals, and the unadjusted screening across 11,448 pairs clear. The feeder results pool age groups. Retain the approved H1 comparison and complete sensitivity passage as the answer to entry by age. Graph size and degree can describe the transfer sample briefly. [Feeder results](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/premier_league_feeder_summary.md) · [Primary feeder figure](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/premier_league_feeder_findings/combined.pdf) · [Agreed H1 wording](../evidence_and_sources.md#agreed-paper-wording-and-resolution)

Carry one whole-network backbone snapshot at α = 0.20 into Issue 09 as a candidate context panel alongside H1. If selected, explain the locally filtered routes, coverage and Louvain colours in the caption. Retain the full community analyses, ownership comparison and backbone cutoff comparisons in the repository. Their evidence retains the single shuffled community graph, the bounded ownership screen and two manual inclusions, and the exact backbone cutoff tie with raw R/Python agreement of 29/30. [Restricted evidence handoff](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/provenance/output_parity_report.md) · [Backbone summary](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/output/louvain_transfer_backbone_findings/backbone_summary.md)

Issue 06 is Resolved. The [storyline](../paper_storyline.md#transfer-network-context-21-november-2026) and [README checkpoint](../README.md#current-checkpoint) record the agreed choices. No network analysis was added or rerun. Begin [Issue 07](2026-11-19_15-30-34_07-research-literature-and-verify-citations.scratch#next-action-to-discuss) by agreeing the literature questions on age and recruitment and age-related media evaluation, and identifying the method references to verify. Issue 15 remains open for the H2b decisions.

